  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPROVE THE EFFICIENCY AND IMPACT OF URBAN DEVELOPMENT COOPERATION IN TWO KEY AREAS, A) MAKING UNPRECEDENTED IMPROVEMENTS IN THE LIVING CONDITIONS OF THE URBAN POOR BY DEVELOPING CITYWIDE AND NATIONWIDE SLUM-UPGRADING PROGRAMS AND SUPPORTING CITY BASED CONSENSUS BUILDING PROCESSES BY WHICH LOCAL STAKEHOLDERS DEFINE THEIR VISION FOR THEIR CITY AND ESTABLISH CITY DEVELOPMENT STRATEGIES WITH CLEAR PRIORITIES FOR ACTION AND INVESTMENTS.</narrative>
  </description>
